    <rdfs:label>CRLF Injection</rdfs:label>
    <riskonto:description>Reusable vulnerability archetype for CRLF Injection within the Injection Vulnerabilities family, aligned to OWASP, CWE, NIST, ATT&amp;CK, and related cybersecurity guidance.</riskonto:description>
    <rdfs:comment>Reusable vulnerability archetype for CRLF Injection within the Injection Vulnerabilities family, aligned to OWASP, CWE, NIST, ATT&amp;CK, and related cybersecurity guidance.</rdfs:comment>
