    <rdfs:label>Typosquatting Dependency Reasoning Trace</rdfs:label>
    <riskonto:traceText>Typosquatting Dependency → CWE-829 → T1036 → M1017 → Software Update → ID.RA-07 → Identify</riskonto:traceText>
