    <rdfs:label>Account Access Removal</rdfs:label>
    <riskonto:description>Adversaries may interrupt availability of system and network resources by inhibiting access to accounts utilized by legitimate users. Accounts may be deleted, locked, or manipulated (ex: credentials changed) to remove access to accounts.</riskonto:description>
