    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://cs.unb.ca/ontologies/riskonto#CWE"/>
    <rdfs:label>Reliance on Untrusted Inputs in a Security Decision</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>The product uses a protection mechanism that relies on the existence or values of an input, but the input can be modified by an untrusted actor in a way that bypasses the protection mechanism.</rdfs:comment>
