  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://cs.unb.ca/ontologies/riskonto#T0845">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://cs.unb.ca/ontologies/riskonto#AttackTechnique"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://cs.unb.ca/ontologies/riskonto#ICSTechnique"/>
    <rdfs:label>Program Upload</rdfs:label>
    <riskonto:description>Adversaries may attempt to upload a program from a PLC to gather information about an industrial process. Uploading a program may allow them to acquire and study the underlying logic. Methods of program upload include vendor software, which enables the user to upload and read a program running on a PLC. This software can be used to upload the target program to a workstation, jump box, or an interfacing device.</riskonto:description>
    <rdfs:comment>Adversaries may attempt to upload a program from a PLC to gather information about an industrial process. Uploading a program may allow them to acquire and study the underlying logic. Methods of program upload include vendor software, which enables the user to upload and read a program running on a PLC. This software can be used to upload the target program to a workstation, jump box, or an interfacing device.</rdfs:comment>
    <riskonto:techniqueID>T0845</riskonto:techniqueID>
    <riskonto:externalID>T0845</riskonto:externalID>
    <riskonto:platform>ics</riskonto:platform>
    <riskonto:mitigatedBy rdf:resource="https://cs.unb.ca/ontologies/riskonto#M0800"/>
    <riskonto:mitigatedBy rdf:resource="https://cs.unb.ca/ontologies/riskonto#M0801"/>
    <riskonto:mitigatedBy rdf:resource="https://cs.unb.ca/ontologies/riskonto#M0802"/>
    <riskonto:mitigatedBy rdf:resource="https://cs.unb.ca/ontologies/riskonto#M0804"/>
