    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://cs.unb.ca/ontologies/riskonto#CWE"/>
    <rdfs:label>Improper Neutralization of CRLF Sequences in HTTP Headers ('HTTP Request/Response Splitting')</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>The product receives data from an HTTP agent/component (e.g., web server, proxy, browser, etc.), but it does not neutralize or incorrectly neutralizes CR and LF characters before the data is included in outgoing HTTP headers.</rdfs:comment>
