* Testing / development credentials (i.e., [Unsecured Credentials](https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1552))
* Work / project schedules
* Source code snippets
* Links to network shares and other internal resources</rdfs:comment>
    <riskonto:techniqueID>T1213.001</riskonto:techniqueID>
    <riskonto:externalID>T1213.001</riskonto:externalID>
