  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://cs.unb.ca/ontologies/riskonto#CWE-294">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://cs.unb.ca/ontologies/riskonto#CWE"/>
    <rdfs:label>Authentication Bypass by Capture-replay</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>A capture-replay flaw exists when the design of the product makes it possible for a malicious user to sniff network traffic and bypass authentication by replaying it to the server in question to the same effect as the original message (or with minor changes).</rdfs:comment>
