    <rdfs:label>Cross-Site Request Forgery (CSRF)</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>The web application does not, or cannot, sufficiently verify whether a request was intentionally provided by the user who sent the request, which could have originated from an unauthorized actor.</rdfs:comment>
