    <riskonto:hasRecommendedAction>Implement SP 800-53r5 controls addressing NIST CSF 2.0 functions: Detect, Identify, Protect, Recover, Respond. Apply 13 identified ATT&amp;CK mitigation(s) verified against 1 CWE weakness(es).</riskonto:hasRecommendedAction>
