    <rdfs:label>Mechanical Protection Layers</rdfs:label>
    <riskonto:description>Utilize a layered protection design based on physical or mechanical protection systems to prevent damage to property, equipment, human safety, or the environment. Examples include interlocks, rupture disk, release values, etc. (Citation: A G Foord, W G Gulland, C R Howard, T Kellacher, W H Smith 2004)</riskonto:description>
