    <rdfs:comment>Template: VP-&gt;affectsSubcategory-&gt;NIST-&gt;hasControl-&gt;CTRL; VP-&gt;affectsFunction-&gt;FN; Required: derivedFromSubcategory, derivedFromControl, hasImpact</rdfs:comment>
