    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://cs.unb.ca/ontologies/riskonto#CWE"/>
    <rdfs:label>Improper Initialization</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>The product does not initialize or incorrectly initializes a resource, which might leave the resource in an unexpected state when it is accessed or used.</rdfs:comment>
