  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://cs.unb.ca/ontologies/riskonto#T1023">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://cs.unb.ca/ontologies/riskonto#AttackTechnique"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://cs.unb.ca/ontologies/riskonto#EnterpriseTechnique"/>
    <rdfs:label>Shortcut Modification</rdfs:label>
    <riskonto:description>Shortcuts or symbolic links are ways of referencing other files or programs that will be opened or executed when the shortcut is clicked or executed by a system startup process. Adversaries could use shortcuts to execute their tools for persistence. They may create a new shortcut as a means of indirection that may use [Masquerading](https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1036) to look like a legitimate program. Adversaries could also edit the target path or entirely replace an existing shortcut so their tools will be executed instead of the intended legitimate program.</riskonto:description>
    <rdfs:comment>Shortcuts or symbolic links are ways of referencing other files or programs that will be opened or executed when the shortcut is clicked or executed by a system startup process. Adversaries could use shortcuts to execute their tools for persistence. They may create a new shortcut as a means of indirection that may use [Masquerading](https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1036) to look like a legitimate program. Adversaries could also edit the target path or entirely replace an existing shortcut so their tools will be executed instead of the intended legitimate program.</rdfs:comment>
    <riskonto:techniqueID>T1023</riskonto:techniqueID>
    <riskonto:externalID>T1023</riskonto:externalID>
    <riskonto:platform>enterprise</riskonto:platform>
    <riskonto:mitigatedBy rdf:resource="https://cs.unb.ca/ontologies/riskonto#M1018"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://cs.unb.ca/ontologies/mappings#map_02726_T1629_M1011_mobile">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://cs.unb.ca/ontologies/mappings#Mapping"/>
    <mappings:fromTechnique rdf:resource="https://cs.unb.ca/ontologies/riskonto#T1629"/>
    <mappings:toMitigation rdf:resource="https://cs.unb.ca/ontologies/riskonto#M1011"/>
