  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://cs.unb.ca/ontologies/riskonto#CWE-1039">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://cs.unb.ca/ontologies/riskonto#CWE"/>
    <rdfs:label>Inadequate Detection or Handling of Adversarial Input Perturbations in Automated Recognition Mechanism</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>The product uses an automated mechanism such as machine learning to recognize complex data inputs (e.g. image or audio) as a particular concept or category, but it does not properly detect or handle inputs that have been modified or constructed in a way that causes the mechanism to detect a different, incorrect concept.</rdfs:comment>
