    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://cs.unb.ca/ontologies/riskonto#CWE"/>
    <rdfs:label>Stack-based Buffer Overflow</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>A stack-based buffer overflow condition is a condition where the buffer being overwritten is allocated on the stack (i.e., is a local variable or, rarely, a parameter to a function).</rdfs:comment>
