    <rdfs:label>Privilege Chaining</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Two distinct privileges, roles, capabilities, or rights can be combined in a way that allows an entity to perform unsafe actions that would not be allowed without that combination.</rdfs:comment>
