Additionally, adversaries may use [Masquerading](https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1036) techniques (such as changing DLL file names, file extensions, or function names) to further conceal execution of a malicious payload.(Citation: rundll32.exe defense evasion)</rdfs:comment>
    <riskonto:techniqueID>T1218.011</riskonto:techniqueID>
