    <rdfs:label>Certificate Rotation</rdfs:label>
    <riskonto:description>Certificate rotation involves replacing digital certificates and their private keys to maintain cryptographic integrity and trust, mitigating key compromise risks and ensuring continuous secure communications.</riskonto:description>
